extends layout

block content
    .div These bearer tokens can be used when you want to give a tool temporary, scoped access to cveprocess.
    .div Tokens are intentionally short-lived (hours); long-lived authentication tokens are not supported.
    table
      tr
        th PMC
        th Operations
        th Token
      tr
        td (unrestricted)
        td all
        td !{token}
      each ts,pmc in tokens
        each tok,op in ts
          tr 
            td !{pmc} 
            td !{op} 
            td !{tok} 
